10. Regression Check

After fixing a finding, search the repository for similar patterns.

For example, if fixing:

SQL injection

also search for:

Other raw SQL construction
String concatenation
Dynamic SQL
Unsafe query building

If fixing:

Hardcoded secret

also search for:

Passwords
Tokens
API keys
Connection strings
Certificates/private keys
Secrets in configuration

If fixing:

Path traversal

also search for:

Other user-controlled file paths
File.Read*
File.Write*
Path.Combine*
Directory operations

The objective is to remediate the class of problem, not only the reported occurrence.

⸻

11. Change Scope

Keep changes limited to:

Required security fixes
Required quality fixes
Necessary supporting changes
Required tests

Do not:

Rewrite the application
Change architecture unnecessarily
Upgrade unrelated dependencies
Rename unrelated classes
Reformat entire files
Modify unrelated modules

